# behavior: every public standard-library name 0.5.1 exports imports from the module 0.5.1 exports it from, 586 names in 70 modules, std.rust's capability markers included (T10.8, #3144)
# expect-accepted:

# The list is 0.5.1's public names: each module's pub declarations and its prelude's re-exports, without names or modules
# that start with an underscore. GraphNode and GraphEdge are private in 0.6 (#2524); importing them is refused with their
# replacements, NodeId and EdgeId, in check/refused/std_graph_private_graph_node and std_graph_private_graph_edge.
